Package: cpxy-router
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: ip-full, kmod-tun
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: cpxy-ng
Description: cpxy proxy for the LAN: native shared packet engine and dns_split wired into OpenWrt
 Routes LAN TCP through a cpxy server (CN traffic goes direct) and resolves LAN DNS with
 dns_split. Configure /etc/config/cpxy. Removing the package restores the original setup.
